# .gitignore — myPublicHarness
#
# 依据 AGENTS.md §6「禁止把 build 产物提交入库（.gitignore 已覆盖）」。
# 2026-10-31 审计发现：本文件此前根本不存在，导致 38 个 .obj/.exe/.pdb 与
# 41 个 CPU1_* 构建产物被 git 跟踪。本文件建立后这些产物已用
# `git rm -r --cached` 从索引移除（工作区文件保留，不删盘）。
#
# 不排除的东西（有意为之，别顺手加）：
#   build-verify/*.log       门禁运行的记录，是 DoD 的证据链
#   harness/tests/on-target/records/*.md   HIL / 故障注入记录，被 trace.json 引用
#   projects/*/state.json    体积与 HIL 状态快照，受 state.schema.json 约束

# ---- 编译器 / 链接器产物 ------------------------------------------------
*.obj
*.o
*.d
*.out
*.map
*.pdb
*.ilk
*.lib
*.a
*.hex
*.bin
*_linkInfo.xml
*.nativecodeanalysis.xml
vc140.pdb

# ---- CCS / Eclipse 构建目录与 IDE 文件 ----------------------------------
projects/*/CPU1_FLASH/
projects/*/CPU1_RAM/
.settings/
*.launch
.cproject
.project
.ccsproject
.metadata/

# ---- 主机单测构建输出 ----------------------------------------------------
harness/tests/host/build-analyze/*.obj
harness/tests/host/build-analyze/*.pdb
harness/tests/host/build-msvc/
harness/tests/host/build-host-msvc/*.obj
harness/tests/host/build-host-msvc/*.exe
harness/tests/host/build-host-msvc/*.pdb
harness/tests/host/build-host-msvc/*.ilk
harness/tests/host/build-host-msvc/*.txt

# ---- 原始运行日志（散、每次运行都变；结论以 records/*.md 为准）----------
harness/tests/on-target/records/hil-dss-*.log
harness/tests/on-target/records/hil-sci-*.log
harness/tests/on-target/records/diag*-out.log
harness/tests/on-target/records/diag*-com*.log
harness/tests/on-target/records/diag*-dss.log
harness/tests/on-target/records/loadti-sci-test.log
harness/tests/on-target/records/diag15-*.log

# ---- OS / 编辑器噪声 -----------------------------------------------------
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
*.swp
*~
